- Optimistic updates for cart quantity and wishlist toggle with rollback on failure.
- Cart count and total in the header update live.
- Empty states for empty cart, empty wishlist, no search results, no orders.
- Accessible: semantic HTML, labels, focus states, keyboard navigation, `alt` text, `aria-live` for toasts, sufficient contrast.
- SEO basics: `<title>` and meta description per page, Open Graph tags, favicon.
