### 8.2 Responsiveness
Test and fix layouts at 360, 390, 768, 1024, 1280 and 1536 px. No horizontal scrolling. Mobile uses the bottom tab bar and bottom sheets; tablet uses 3-column grids; desktop uses the sidebar filters and full header. Images are responsive with `loading="lazy"`, fixed aspect ratios (1:1 or 4:3) so layout does not jump.

